  "cheatNotes": [
    "_` Random Select (1P side)",
    "- On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Liu Kang ^8 and press _S",
    "_` Random Select (2P side)",
    "- On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Reptile ^8 and press _S",
    "_` Disable Throws",
    "- On the vs. Screen ^2_+_O^G on both sides",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "_` Fight Jade on Secret Stage \"?\"",
    "- On Stage 11, win a round using only ^H",
    "_` Fight Smoke",
    "- On The Portal Stage",
    "- Dan Forden must appear and say \"Toasty\" (usually appears after an Uppercut)",
    "- Press _2_+_S",
    "_` Fight Noob Saibot",
    "- Win 50 matches in a row",
    "_` Pong",
    "- Fight 250 matches in a row",
    "_` Show Longest Winning Streaks",
    "- During the Attractive Mode press _2 on both sides",
    "_` EJB Menu",
    "- During the Attractive Mode press _G_G_G_G_G on 1P side, _G_G_G_G_G_G_G_G_G_G on 2P side, _G_G on 1P side, _G_G_G_G_G_G_G_G on 2P side, _G_G on 1P side",
    "- Must be entered at a very fast speed"
